OL,3,GNEWSABBL filler found in heart and
OL,4,Alungs after mum died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "gel-like" liquid was found in blood
OL,7,Fvessels in the brain, lungs, and heart
OL,8,Fof a woman who died shortly after
OL,9,Fhaving a Brazilian Butt Lift (BBL)
OL,10,Fprocedure, an inquest has heard.
OL,12,FMother-of-five Alice Webb, 33,
OL,13,Fcollapsed at a friend's house in
OL,14,FGloucester on 23 September 2024 and
OL,15,Fdied the following day.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34702
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1795013790
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSABBL filler found in heart and
OL,4,Alungs after mum died
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a jury inquest at
OL,7,FGloucestershire Coroner's Court on
OL,8,FWednesday, Dr Stephen Leadbeatter, a
OL,9,FHome Office forensic pathologist, said
OL,10,Fhe considered her cause of death to be
OL,11,F"embolisation of hyaluronic acid from
OL,12,Fintroduction into buttocks".
OL,14,FEmbolisation is when something is
OL,15,Fcarried in the bloodstream from one
OL,16,Fpart of the body to another. Hyaluronic
OL,17,Facid was the filler used in the
OL,18,Fprocedure.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
